# Spec-driven workflow

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the navigator. Do not explore the whole repo by default.

1. Read `context/progress-tracker.md`.
2. Feature work requires a spec in `specs/` with status `ready` or `in-progress`. If none exists, draft or wait — do not invent behavior.
3. Open only the context and source files `AGENTS.md` maps for this task.
4. Implement against the spec and `context/ai-workflow-rules.md`.
5. When the unit ends, update the spec status and `context/progress-tracker.md`.

Never invent case studies, testimonials, metrics, or new pages without a spec.
